{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/52904-custom-masks-and-dirges","id":52904,"title":"Custom Masks and Dirges","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-18T18:21:58-08:00","id":52904,"title":"Custom Masks and Dirges","content":"I think masks and dirges are one of the harder concepts to get a hang of in the new rules. Why don't we have a thread devoted to some custom masks and dirges our characters are using (or that we've come up with)? Normally this is where I'd post the first entry myself, but I must say I struggle a bit on this field, so I look to you others to open the first dance.<br /> <br /> Edit: Wait, I think I might have an idea.<br /> <b>Voyeur</b><br /> You enjoy watching the world and the people around you, more so than interacting with them. You take great pleasure out of observing someone's secret moments.<br /> <i>Single willpower</i>: Discover a secret, or a new person's habits.<br /> <i>All willpower</i>: Refuse to intervene in a situation you're observing, even though it would be the &quot;right thing&quot; to do.<br /> <br /> It's a bit vague, but I think the intent is clear enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Homebrew</b><br /> - CtL 2E: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1290961-additional-seeming-benefits-for-contracts-2e?p=1454478#post1454478\" target=\"_blank\">Seeming Benefits for every Contract</a>","edited":{"userid":1292,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1292-unahim","user":"Unahim","date":". 01-18-2014, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1292-unahim","name":"Unahim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1292_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1080"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T19:06:42-08:00","id":52928,"title":"","content":"I was gonna respond to this later and will probably just expand on this post but one of our players has Voyeur as their Dirge. The single willpower is pretty much the same, but the All Willpower is when you place yourself at considerable risk (like spying on a group of vampires or someone else who could sense you and do something if they did so).<br /> <br /> Bully.<br /> Single Willpower: Mercilessly tormenting an individual.<br /> All Willpower: Get others who aren't obliged to follow PC to join in tormenting an individual.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 01-19-2014, 08:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-18T22:06:08-08:00","id":53010,"title":"","content":"These are two my group made.<br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:21px\">Professional</span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">A professional takes pride in work and the fruits of their labor. They don\u2019t need a tangible reward or praise to motivate herself. Whatever the job, they\u2019ll put their absolute best effort into the task at hand. Whatever their personal state, they can handle it.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Single Willpower:</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Complete a task without regard for your emotional health or safety.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">All Willpower:</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Complete a difficult task or assignment at great personal risk.</span></span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-size:21px\">Idol</span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">An idol wants to be adored, desperately. They want everyone around them to respect them, fear them or love them. Any combination thereof may be perfectly acceptable as well. What they do with that love, fear or respect is less concerning than others\u2019 display of it.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Single Willpower:</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Make somebody else pay attention to you, regardless of how they feel.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">All Willpower:</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Draw the wrong kind of attention on yourself, even if it puts you in danger.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T02:53:28-08:00","id":53091,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma\"><b>Haggler</b><br /> The haggler sees opportunities everywhere. She tries to seize these opportunites even if she has to take risks in order to sway her counterparts into agreements, and even if these agreements are dangerous for her. <br /> <b>Single Willpower: </b>Trick, coerce or persuade someobdy to accept a binding agreement that favors you over the other parties. <br /> <b>All Willpower: </b>Make a binding agreement that, if exposed or fulfilled by all parties, could threaten your Requiem.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1769-peterk","name":"PeterK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T04:33:47-08:00","id":53116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/52904-custom-masks-and-dirges?p=52928#post52928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was gonna respond to this later and will probably just expand on this post but one of our players has Voyeur as their Dirge. The single willpower is pretty much the same, but the All Willpower is when you place yourself at considerable risk (like spying on a group of vampires or someone else who could sense you and do something if they did so).</div> </div> </div> </div>Both work! I wanted something a bit selfish, rather than foolhardy, which is why I designed it as I did ^^ Good examples so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Homebrew</b><br /> - CtL 2E: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1290961-additional-seeming-benefits-for-contracts-2e?p=1454478#post1454478\" target=\"_blank\">Seeming Benefits for every Contract</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1292-unahim","name":"Unahim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1292_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1080"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T04:57:32-08:00","id":53128,"title":"","content":"<b>Peacekeeper</b><br /> The peacekeeper makes sure the rules are followed. They are people who keep an eye on things and stick the boot in when things get out of hand, regardless as to whether they agree with the rules or not.<br /> Single Willpower: Put yourself at mild risk to stop an infraction of an area's laws.<br /> All Willpower: Burn a bridge or tarnish your credibility significantly for the sake of maintaining law and order","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/209-that-other-guy","name":"That Other Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T00:16:03-08:00","id":56608,"title":"","content":"<b>Manipulator</b><br /> A manipulator is bent on getting his way . . . but damned if he's going to do it himself when someone else can get their hands dirty instead.<br /> <i>Single Willpower:</i> Convince someone to perform a task for you they wouldn't do otherwise.<br /> <i>All Willpower:</i> Convince someone to take an action that puts them at risk of severe punishment, serious injury or Final Death so long as it benefits <i>you</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">&quot;There is the world of light, and the world of darkness. And some in the light prefer the darkness.&quot; \u2014 Loren Eiseley, <i>The Night Country</i></span>","edited":{"userid":583,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","user":"Zsander","date":". 02-01-2014, 02:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","name":"Zsander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar583_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T00:23:22-08:00","id":56613,"title":"","content":"<b>Creator</b><br /> The creator is an artist, a crafter, a maker of things. Whether <i>objets d'art</i>, tools, or weapons (or any combination of the above), they find inspiration in making something lasting, be it a portrait for the Prince to hang in her Haven, an expertly-forged blade for an Ordo Dracul Sworn of the Axe, a sociopolitical manifesto for the local Movement, or anything else.<br /> <i>Single Willpower:</i> Create a work that impresses or finds use, or put work toward the making of a greater creation.<br /> <i>All Willpower:</i> Sacrifice a social connection or forsake another serious obligation to work on your <i>Magnum Opus</i> instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">&quot;There is the world of light, and the world of darkness. And some in the light prefer the darkness.&quot; \u2014 Loren Eiseley, <i>The Night Country</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/583-zsander","name":"Zsander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar583_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T06:42:14-08:00","id":421686,"title":"","content":"I've added all of these to my list for my game. Thanks.<br /> <br /> I have an NPC who was once the leader of a warband; she loves the idea of others following her.<br /> <br /> The closest official archetype would be cult leader:<br /> <b>**<br /> Cult Leader</b><br /> A cult leader wants for faith and devotion. He may have faith and devotion of his own, but he wants for a group to adore him and his word above all. <i>This may or may not be a religious cult.</i><br /> <b>Single Willpower: </b>Convince someone to deny logic because of your word.<br /> <b>All Willpower: </b>Risk exile or death to defend your cult\u2019s belief system.<br /> **<br /> I'm thinking a new archetype, <b>Leader</b>, should complement Follower and maybe Conformist:<br /> <br /> <b>Leader</b><br /> A leader knows there is strength in numbers, and is convinced that he is the one to guide that strength. He is happiest with loyal followers at his back.<br /> <b>Single Willpower:</b> Convince someone to follow a dangerous directive.<br /> <b>All Willpower:</b> Demonstrate your worthiness to lead by risking serious consequences to defend your followers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2203-corrigan","name":"Corrigan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T07:05:59-08:00","id":421721,"title":"","content":"This thread is great. <br /> <br /> I struggled to think of how to word one for Dependent, meaning you need someone to take care of you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T12:00:49-08:00","id":422058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/52904-custom-masks-and-dirges?p=421721#post421721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This thread is great.<br /> <br /> I struggled to think of how to word one for Dependent, meaning you need someone to take care of you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd use some variation of Child.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T20:04:08-08:00","id":424795,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Andalus, serif\"><b>Conqueror</b></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Andalus, serif\">A conqueror exists to destroy and do anything to defeat foes. A conqueror will finish off an enemy and never leave their opponent standing.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Andalus, serif\"><i>Single Willpower:</i> Defeat someone in combat who challenged you.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Andalus, serif\"><i>All Willpower</i>: Needlessly kill someone who has been defeated.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4812-karhu_fueryon","name":"karhu_fueryon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4812_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T20:10:43-08:00","id":424800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vitalis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/52904-custom-masks-and-dirges?p=421721#post421721\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This thread is great.<br /> <br /> I struggled to think of how to word one for Dependent, meaning you need someone to take care of you.</div> </div> </div> </div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Andalus, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dependent</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">A dependent always needs someone helping him out. A guiding hand through thick and thin to overcome every day.</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Andalus, serif\"><i>Single Willpower</i>: Someone aids you in a minor task that you could do on your own.</span></span></span><br /> <i>All Willpower:</i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Andalus\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> Someone helps you overcome an obstacle that you could not accomplish on your own.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4812-karhu_fueryon","name":"karhu_fueryon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4812_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-10T17:29:12-08:00","id":1360232,"title":"","content":"Plain<br /> A plain just want live a pacific, common life<br /> Single willpower: Avoid the spotlight when doing something unusual<br /> Full willpower: Avoid the spotlight at any cost<br /> <br /> Distant<br /> The distant pass an air of superiority or menace that keep others away<br /> One willpower: make someone avoid want to interact with you (for fear, awe or any other reason)<br /> Full willpower: Make someone or a group avoiding interact with you in a critical situation<br /> <br /> Friendly<br /> The friendly want to connect with the others<br /> One willpower: Create a bound with someone that unexpected, like a social outcast<br /> Full willpower: Create a bound with someone that is really dangerous<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13077-draxdeveloper","name":"draxdeveloper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}